This mutation makes `move_value` avoid stepping next to enemy champions. Steps that would end within 2 tiles of an enemy are penalised, and the value is floored at 10 so a required walk is never zeroed out and the bot does not stall. The step-gain weight is raised from 1 to 10 so closer progress toward GOAL is preferred over the risk penalty.

